:: MP Town Festivals 4 Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _m to Time.date.month>><<set _d to Time.date.day>>
高街布告栏侧下方的木槽第二格挂着四枚镌刻四时半日集期的黄铜副牌：三月二十一日的春分染彩集、六月二十四日的仲夏潮歌会、九月二十九日的秋鹅烘焙集，以及十二月六日的圣尼古拉暖靴集。
<<if not ((_m is 3 and _d gte 18 and _d lte 24) or (_m is 6 and _d gte 21 and _d lte 27) or (_m is 9 and _d gte 26) or (_m is 10 and _d lte 2) or (_m is 12 and _d gte 3 and _d lte 9))>>
	铜牌背面尚未到下一场半日节令的集期，最近的一场还要再等些日子。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回上排铜牌 (0:02)|MP Town Festivals 3 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<if _m is 3 and _d gte 18 and _d lte 24>>
	<<shopicon>><<link [[看茜草染缸 (0:04)|MP Festival SpringDye 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _m is 6 and _d gte 21 and _d lte 27>>
	<<beachicon>><<if Time.dayState is "dusk">><<link [[看浅滩篝火 (0:12)|MP Festival Tidesong 1]]>><<pass 12>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">看浅滩篝火 (0:12)（只有黄昏）</span><</if>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if (_m is 9 and _d gte 26) or (_m is 10 and _d lte 2)>>
	<<mpcookicon>><<link [[看果木砖炉 (0:08)|MP Festival Michaelmas 1]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _m is 12 and _d gte 3 and _d lte 9>>
	<<link [[看门廊挂袜 (0:04)|MP Festival Warmboot 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: MP Festival SpringDye 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpFestScore to 0>>
高街裁缝铺外的青石小院支起了三口紫铜染缸，茜草根与栀子果在沸水里翻滚出明艳的赤金汤色。老染匠正招手请路人帮忙搅动染棒。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回水牌前 (0:03)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="fest-springdye-1">
<<mptailoricon>><<link "搅匀染缸 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#fest-springdye-1">>
<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11400 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>>
	染汤色泽透亮均匀，老染匠笑眯眯地递给你一条刚染好的茜草红丝帕。<span class="green">你帮染坊稳住了头缸春色。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[去扎染长桌 (0:04)|MP Festival SpringDye 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	滚烫染汤溅出一滴落在鞋尖上，热气熏得你鼻尖冒汗。<span class="red">热气扑面，鞋尖沾上了一点红汁。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[垫上干布重起卡扣 (0:04)|MP Festival SpringDye 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[收妥行囊回木牌前 (0:03)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 260>><<link "添柴稳汤温 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#fest-springdye-1">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($science or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>>你往紫铜染缸炉膛里添入两块干燥桦木柴，用长火钳拨匀炭火，将茜草染汤稳稳控在微沸状态。<span class="green">汤色透亮鲜艳，老染匠眉开眼笑地送了你一条红丝帕。</span><<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[去扎染长桌 (0:04)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	灶下地面沾着水渍，你蹲身添柴时脚下微滑，火钳偏了半寸没能拨开闷炭。<span class="red">虎口被火钳震得发麻，你只得先退开半步透口气。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[顺着卯眼重新发力 (0:04)|MP Festival SpringDye 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回入口 (0:03)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">添柴稳汤温 (0:07)（能力不足）</span><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Festival SpringDye 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
染坊廊下的长木桌上铺满洁白生丝帕，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>画师<</if>>正教几个学徒用麻线扎出云纹与蝴蝶花结，准备浸入靛蓝冷染缸。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回水牌前 (0:03)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="fest-springdye-2">
<<mpsewicon>><<if ($danceskill or 0) gte 250 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<link "扎四角蝶翼结 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#fest-springdye-2">>
<<if ($danceskill or 0) gte 240 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>>
	解开麻线后蓝白蝶纹栩栩如生，莫奈赞许地朝你颔首。<span class="green">你扎染出了全场最灵动的蝶翼花帕。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[晾晒彩幡 (0:04)|MP Festival SpringDye 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	麻线打结略松，靛蓝染汁渗进了留白处，花纹晕成了一团。<span class="red">麻线松脱导致染汁渗入留白。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[擦净指腹重按簧片 (0:04)|MP Festival SpringDye 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[拍净衣袖回木牌前 (0:03)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">扎四角蝶翼结 (0:07)（能力不足）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 260 or ($science or 0) gte 260>><<link "按图谱排染序 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#fest-springdye-2">>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 240 or ($science or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>>	你对照莫奈的染谱按浅蓝、靛青、深紫排好浸缸时长，挂起丝帕时过渡如水墨晕染。<span class="green">莫奈笑着夸你对色彩层次极有灵气。</span><<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>><<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[晾晒彩幡 (0:04)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
冷染缸边缘湿滑，你提帕出缸时滴落的染液溅脏了旁边待染的白纱。<span class="red">你连忙拿清水抢洗，忙出一头热汗。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[找准支点重新撬动 (0:04)|MP Festival SpringDye 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[顺着街巷回木牌前 (0:03)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">按图谱排染序 (0:07)（学识不足）</span><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Festival SpringDye 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
院心高高架起的晾布竹竿上挂满五彩春幡，一阵春风吹来，最高处那幅金线彩绸缠在了竹梢枝杈上。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回水牌前 (0:03)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="fest-springdye-3">
<<mptailoricon>><<link "竹竿挑开绸角 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#fest-springdye-3">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>>
	五彩春幡迎风舒展飘扬，围观街坊爆发出一阵喝彩。<span class="green">春幡完好无损地在晴空下迎风招展。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[参加彩缕评比 (0:04)|MP Festival SpringDye 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	木凳在青石板上晃了一下，你扶住晾衣架才站稳，手心擦破一点皮。<span class="red">木凳摇晃擦红了你的掌心。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[扶稳器座重调角度 (0:04)|MP Festival SpringDye 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂退一步 (0:03)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>><<link "拉绳解开绸 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#fest-springdye-3">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>>
	<<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>>你握住晾布竹架侧面的副引绳，顺着春风吹拂的方向轻轻一抖，缠在横竿上的五彩春幡顿时顺滑解开。<span class="green">满院春幡迎风招展，围观街坊纷纷向你投来赞许目光。</span><<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[参加彩缕评比 (0:04)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	引绳末端沾着染坊皂水，你拉动时绳结滑了一下，衣袖也蹭上了一点浮沫。<span class="red">好在管事并未责怪，只让你换根干麻绳再拉。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[屏住气息重新摸索 (0:04)|MP Festival SpringDye 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[顺着街巷回木牌前 (0:03)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">拉绳解开绸 (0:07)（能力不足）</span><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Festival SpringDye 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
午后阳光最暖时，染匠们把各色丝缕挂在街心花架下请路人品评，还要给孤儿院的孩子们分赠辟邪五色线。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回水牌前 (0:03)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="fest-springdye-4">
<<mpsewicon>><<link "给孩子系丝缕 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#fest-springdye-4">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>>
	孩子们欢天喜地地围着你转，几位外地游客也大方地投下了赞赏银币。<span class="green">热闹的评比席间充满了欢声笑语。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[收染架去案前 (0:04)|MP Festival SpringDye 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	人流拥挤中有人踩了你的脚背一下，五色线也乱成了一团。<span class="red">人群拥挤让你脚背被踩得生疼。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[借着侧光重对刻痕 (0:04)|MP Festival SpringDye 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[整好衣领回木牌前 (0:03)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "讲解春染古法 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#fest-springdye-4">>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>>你站在街心花架旁，指着茜草、蓝草与栀子标本向围观游客娓娓道来古法草木春染的三浸三晒工序。<span class="green">游客们听得津津有味，纷纷往评比铜盆里投下赞赏银币。</span><<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[收染架去案前 (0:04)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	一阵穿堂春风吹乱了展示台上的色卡纸，你伸手按住时话头被打断，一时忘了后半段口诀。<span class="red">你忙笑着将色卡理齐，先退到<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>画师<</if>>身旁缓口气。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[扣紧边沿重新提拉 (0:04)|MP Festival SpringDye 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[转身步回木牌前 (0:03)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Festival SpringDye 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
夕阳西下，春分染彩集接近尾声。老染匠把晒干的头等茜草丝帕与一份节令工钱封进红纸袋递到你手里。<span class="green">你在春分染彩集度过了充实而温暖的半日时光。</span>
<<if ($mpFestScore or 0) lte 0>>
	<span class="teal">染彩集几道工序都出了岔子，老染匠只塞给你一碗姜汤驱寒。</span>
<<elseif window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_springdye_reward")>>
	<<if ($mpFestScore or 0) gte 4>>
		<<money 650>><span class="gold">你圆满完成了染彩集四道工序，收下 £6.50 全勤红封。</span>
	<<else>>
		<<money 350>><span class="gold">你帮衬了染彩集部分工序，收下 £3.50 帮工红封。</span>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	染彩集红封已经拆过，只剩淡淡的纸香。
<</if>>
<<stress -6>><<trauma -2>><<lstress>><<ltrauma>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[收丝帕工钱返程 (0:04)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Festival Tidesong 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "beach">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpFestScore to 0>>
仲夏傍晚的海滩上堆起了干燥的浮木篝火堆，海风带着微咸暖意，渔民们正忙着在防风槽里淋松脂助燃。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回水牌前 (0:12)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="fest-tidesong-1">
<<mpcarryicon>><<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>><<link "按风向垒浮木 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#fest-tidesong-1">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>>
	橘红色的篝火腾空而起照亮浅滩，老水手递给你一串烤得滋滋冒油的扇贝。<span class="green">海滩篝火熊熊燃起映红了暮色。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[串贝壳风铃 (0:04)|MP Festival Tidesong 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	海风倒卷吹来一团浓烟，呛得你连咳数声，眼角直泛泪花。<span class="red">逆风浓烟呛得你嗓子发痒。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[握稳工具重调位置 (0:04)|MP Festival Tidesong 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[缓步走回木牌前 (0:12)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">按风向垒浮木 (0:07)（能力不足）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<link "举火点松脂 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#fest-tidesong-1">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>>
	<<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>>你举起火把绕到浮木堆迎风侧，精准点燃底层的干燥松脂枝，火苗借着海风瞬间引燃了整座篝火。<span class="green">橘红火光腾空而起，老水手笑着塞给你一串烤扇贝。</span><<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[串贝壳风铃 (0:12)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<else>>
	底层浮木还带着海潮湿气，松脂枝燃起一半便冒出白烟，熏得你连退半步。<span class="red">为免浓烟呛着周围镇民，你先移开火把拨松木柴。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[压住台面重新着力 (0:04)|MP Festival Tidesong 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[收妥行囊回木牌前 (0:12)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Festival Tidesong 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "beach">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
浅滩凉棚下摆着成筐的白螺壳与彩贝，姑娘们正用细铜丝串制仲夏祈福风铃，挂上栈桥栏杆听海风伴奏。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回水牌前 (0:12)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="fest-tidesong-2">
<<mpsewicon>><<link "编扇贝风铃 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#fest-tidesong-2">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>>
	海风拂过时贝壳风铃叮咚作响，宛如潮水低吟，摊主送了你一枚珍珠母贝挂件。<span class="green">你串制的贝壳风铃音色最为清越。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[加入踏浪合唱 (0:04)|MP Festival Tidesong 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	贝壳边缘锋利，穿铜丝时不小心在指腹上划出了一道浅印。<span class="red">锋利贝壳边沿刮痛了你的指腹。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[垫上干布重起卡扣 (0:04)|MP Festival Tidesong 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂退一步 (0:12)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
