:: MP Festival Tidesong 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "beach">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
手风琴声在篝火旁响起，镇民们挽着手臂赤脚踩进温凉的浪花里，齐声哼唱古老的仲夏平潮歌。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回水牌前 (0:12)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="fest-tidesong-3">
<<tendingicon>><<link "踩浪花旋身共舞 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#fest-tidesong-3">>
<<if ($danceskill or 0) gte 250 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>>
	欢快的歌声与浪涛声融为一体，身旁的舞伴将一顶编满海石竹的花环戴在你头上。<span class="green">你在踏浪歌舞中忘却了所有烦恼。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[端碗灯去放灯 (0:04)|MP Festival Tidesong 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	一个浪头打来，你脚底在湿沙上一滑，裙摆裤脚全湿透了。<span class="red">浪花打湿了半截衣裤。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[擦净指腹重按簧片 (0:04)|MP Festival Tidesong 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[拍净衣袖回木牌前 (0:12)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 260 or ($seductionskill or 0) gte 250>><<link "唱准副歌高音 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#fest-tidesong-3">>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 250 or ($seductionskill or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>>	你顺着手风琴扬起的尾音清亮起调，将仲夏平潮歌的高音部稳稳托向夜海。<span class="green">篝火四周响起一片喝彩与掌声。</span><<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>><<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[端碗灯去放灯 (0:12)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<else>>
海风灌进喉咙呛了一下，高音尾音微微发飘，被海浪声盖了过去。<span class="red">嗓子有些干痒，你只得先低声跟着哼唱。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[找准支点重新撬动 (0:04)|MP Festival Tidesong 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[顺着街巷回木牌前 (0:12)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">唱准副歌高音 (0:07)（能力不足）</span><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Festival Tidesong 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "searocks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
夜潮退向远海，人们捧着点亮蜂蜡的木碗水灯走上礁石浅湾，准备顺着退潮暗流将心愿放入夜海。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回水牌前 (0:12)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
