:: MP Festival Tidesong 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "beach">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
仲夏潮歌会在繁星下散场，帮忙照看篝火与水灯的你分到了一份海事互助会发出的节令茶资与果酒。<span class="green">你在仲夏潮歌会度过了充实而温暖的半日时光。</span>
<<if ($mpFestScore or 0) lte 0>>
	<span class="teal">潮歌会几道工序都出了岔子，老水手只分给你一碗热鱼汤暖胃。</span>
<<elseif window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_tidesong_reward")>>
	<<if ($mpFestScore or 0) gte 4>>
		<<money 650>><span class="gold">你圆满完成了潮歌会四道工序，收下 £6.50 全勤红封。</span>
	<<else>>
		<<money 350>><span class="gold">你帮衬了潮歌会部分工序，收下 £3.50 帮工红封。</span>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	潮歌会红封已经拆过，只剩淡淡的纸香。
<</if>>
<<stress -6>><<trauma -2>><<lstress>><<ltrauma>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[收茶资踏月返程 (0:12)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>

:: MP Festival Michaelmas 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "pub">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpFestScore to 0>>
九月秋风送爽，丰收街酒馆前院摆开长案，木盆里堆满刚摘的青苹果与核桃仁，正要切丁拌入烤鹅腹馅。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回水牌前 (0:08)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
