:: MP Festival Michaelmas 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "pub">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
院子中央抬上了今年头一桶秋收新麦芽酒，酒馆老板举着木槌，请你帮忙稳住龙头木塞免得泡沫喷洒。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回水牌前 (0:08)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
