</div>

:: MP Festival Michaelmas 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "pub">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
暮色里秋鹅烘焙集热闹散席，酒馆老板将打包好的脆皮鹅腿餐盒与今日帮工红封一并塞进你怀里。<span class="green">你在秋鹅烘焙集度过了充实而温暖的半日时光。</span>
<<if ($mpFestScore or 0) lte 0>>
	<span class="teal">烘焙集几道工序都出了岔子，厨娘只盛给你一小碗热苹果汤。</span>
<<elseif window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_michaelmas_reward")>>
	<<if ($mpFestScore or 0) gte 4>>
		<<money 650>><span class="gold">你圆满完成了烘焙集四道工序，收下 £6.50 全勤红封。</span>
	<<else>>
		<<money 350>><span class="gold">你帮衬了烘焙集部分工序，收下 £3.50 帮工红封。</span>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	烘焙集红封已经拆过，只剩淡淡的纸香。
<</if>>
<<stress -6>><<trauma -2>><<lstress>><<ltrauma>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[收好红封返回 (0:08)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>

:: MP Festival Warmboot 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpFestScore to 0>>
十二月初的宅邸街飘着细碎雪花，家家户户门廊下挂起了冷杉松枝。孤儿院外廊前，大家正忙着把羊毛长袜挂上木栏。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回水牌前 (0:03)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="fest-warmboot-1">
<<mpsewicon>><<link "红绒绳扎暖袜 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#fest-warmboot-1">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>>
	翠绿松枝配着红白羊毛袜把长廊装点得暖意融融，路过邻居笑着塞给你一把太妃糖。<span class="green">外廊挂满了充满节日气息的松枝暖袜。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[分装胡桃蜜橘 (0:08)|MP Festival Warmboot 2]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	冷杉针叶扎了一下你冻红的指尖，木梯上还落下一捧积雪。<span class="red">松针扎手且积雪落进了衣领。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[借着侧光重对刻痕 (0:04)|MP Festival Warmboot 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[整好衣领回木牌前 (0:03)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "登梯挂彩带 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#fest-warmboot-1">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 240 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>>你登上人字木梯，将红金相间的冬幕彩带与冷杉松枝交错缠绕，稳稳挂上门廊最高处的雕花檐角。<span class="green">整条外廊被装点得喜气洋洋，路过邻居笑着塞给你一把太妃糖。</span><<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[分装胡桃蜜橘 (0:04)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	檐角铁钩在冬日寒风里冻得冰凉，彩带铜环卡在半途一时难以扣到底。<span class="red">高处举手太久令小臂泛起酸意，你只得先下梯暖一暖手。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[扣紧边沿重新提拉 (0:04)|MP Festival Warmboot 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[转身步回木牌前 (0:03)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

